%
%  Conventions used in this template:
%   * cite keys are firstauthor_year_keyword, e.g. odipio_2017_efficient
%   * titles are sentence-cased by biblatex-apa, so protect anything that
%     must keep its capitals with braces: {DNA}, {PCR}, {Manihot}, {Uganda}
